**Memo**

To: Dr. Emily Rodriguez, Chief Engineer, Orbital Dynamics  
From: Michael Chen, Program Manager, Advanced Satellite Systems  
Date: March 15, 2024  
Subject: Collaboration on Titan-5 Launch Preparations  

As we prepare for the Titan-5 satellite launch scheduled for July 12, 2024, I wanted to highlight the critical partnership between Orbital Dynamics and NorthStar Defense Systems, who are providing the launch vehicle and support systems. It is essential that our teams align on the integration of the Titan-5 payload with the Falcon-9 rocket to ensure all pre-launch tests are completed by June 1. Additionally, the coordination with the Space Launch Complex 40 at Cape Canaveral is crucial for our timeline and will require daily updates to mitigate any potential delays. 